### GET caseId by externalId
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/iusta/cases/by-external-id/{{externalId}}

### CASE

### GET case standard fields by caseId
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/iusta/cases/{{caseId}}/standard-fields
    ?fields=id,customerId,createdAt,updatedAt

### GET case custom fields by caseId
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/iusta/cases/{{caseId}}/custom-fields
    ?ids=23701,23683,23702
    &fields=customFieldId,value

### CUSTOMER

### GET customer standard fields by customerId
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/iusta/customers/{{customerId}}/standard-fields
    ?fields=name,surname,id,phoneNumber

### GET customer custom fields by customerId
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/iusta/customers/{{customerId}}/custom-fields
    ?ids=24535
    &fields=customFieldId,value